# spec: ports, userinfo, IPv6 literals and percent-encoded characters
### port
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items
### userinfo
GET http://admin:s3cret@legacy.example.com:8080/status
### ipv6
GET http://[2001:db8::1]:9200/_cluster/health
### ipv6-loopback
GET http://[::1]:8080/ping
### percent-encoded
GET https://example.com/files/My%20Report%20(final).pdf?path=%2Fusr%2Flocal&q=a%2Bb
